-- Generated by scripts/relativity_mes_seed (deterministic, master_seed=20260626). DO NOT hand-edit;
-- regenerate with: python -m scripts.relativity_mes_seed.emit
-- Shaped like a Manufacturo MES + generic ERP/PLM facsimile. Not real Relativity data,
-- not a real schema, not a real API. Every row carries synthetic=true.

-- Serving tables are the Postgres/Lakebase read layer the FastAPI routes query. They are
